    "bodySnippet": "A\nAsterion Study\nCAIE 9709 Study Hub\nCourses\nP1\nP3\nM1\nS1\n\nP1 FIELD GUIDE\n\nSeries Field Guide\n\nLearn one idea at a time, then try a short Skill Check.\n\nBack to topics\nTry 3 quick questions\n𝑢\n𝑛\n=\n𝑎\n+\n(\n𝑛\n−\n1\n)\n𝑑\n,\n𝑆\n𝑛\n=\n𝑎\n(\n1\n−\n𝑟\n𝑛\n)\n1\n−\n𝑟\nu\nn\n\t​\n\n=a+(n−1)d,S\nn\n\t​\n\n=\n1−r\na(1−r\nn\n)\n\t​\n\n\nNice. Start with one small idea.\n\nOverview\n\nSpot sequence patterns, then use the right formula to find terms or sums quickly.\n\nKey formulae\n𝑢\n𝑛\n=\n𝑎\n+\n(\n𝑛\n−\n1\n)\n𝑑\nu\nn\n\t​\n\n=a+(n−1)d\n𝑆\n𝑛\n=\n𝑛\n2\n[\n2\n𝑎\n+\n(\n𝑛\n−\n1\n)\n𝑑\n]\nS\nn\n\t​\n\n=\n2\nn\n\t​\n\n[2a+(n−1)d]\n𝑆\n𝑛\n=\n𝑛\n2\n(\n𝑎\n+\n𝑙\n)\nS\nn\n\t​\n\n=\n2\nn\n\t​\n\n(a+l)\n𝑢"
  },
